  "description": "A SQLite convenience library layered on Microsoft.Data.Sqlite, providing selective column/object encryption with a pluggable crypt engine (AES-GCM engine included), the typed EncryptedTable<T> abstraction with searchable encrypted data and HMAC blind-index equality search, safe quiesce-and-backup orchestration, and database schema-version helpers. Highlights: encrypt individual values or whole CLR objects at rest, search them without full-table decryption, and back up live databases safely.",
